    <object id="wireless-oc181" label="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;· AF-GUEST: client isolation, captive portal, rate limit, DNS filter; lands in GUEST only.&lt;br&gt;· AF-DEVICES: meeting-room systems only; key rotated quarterly and whenever someone who knew it leaves.&lt;br&gt;· No SSID for cameras, printers or building systems: they are wired.&lt;br&gt;· Rogue AP detection on; management VLAN 99 is never broadcast." netdiagrams_guide="1">
